Package: cdrgam.cli
Title: Project Harness for Continuous-Time Deconvolutional Regression
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Cory", "Shain", , "cory.shain@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2704-7197"))
Description: Manages schema-versioned analysis projects built around the
    'cdrgam' package. A configured checkout validates named definitions,
    constructs dependency graphs, runs work serially or through a shared Slurm
    scheduler and generic worker pool, and publishes reproducible artifacts
    beneath named projects.
